sia since 2012, having previously served from 1999 to 2008.","cites":["wiki:rev:1386843956:0"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:24Z","text":"Vladimir Putin was born on 7 October 1952 in V.F. Snegiryov Maternity Hospital No.6.","cites":["wd:Q7747:P569","wd:Q7747:P19"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:32Z","text":"Educated at Academy of the Federal Security Service of the Russian Federation, Academy of Foreign Intelligence, Saint Petersburg Mining University and 5 more.","cites":["wd:Q7747:P69:Q2387574","wd:Q7747:P69:Q1978570","wd:Q7747:P69:Q2495829","wd:Q7747:P69:Q27621","wd:Q7747:P69:Q103920735","wd:Q7747:P69:Q27430017","wd:Q7747:P69:Q4525174","wd:Q7747:P69:Q4534839"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:40Z","text":"Worked for KGB, First Chief Directorate, Administrative Directorate of the President of the Russian Federation and Presidential Administration of Russia, in Moscow, Saint Petersburg and Dresden.","cites":["wd:Q7747:P108:Q80919","wd:Q7747:P108:Q2031025","wd:Q7747:P108:Q4476368","wd:Q7747:P108:Q2060629","wd:Q7747:P937:Q649","wd:Q7747:P937:Q656","wd:Q7747:P937:Q1731"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:48Z","text":"76 awards on record, among them Time 100 (2022) and Order of Kim Il Sung (2024).","cites":["wd:Q7747:P166:Q512656","wd:Q7747:P166:Q512656"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:55Z","text":"Known for A Plea for Caution From Russia, Russia at the Turn of the Millennium and Russia Muscles Up — the Challenges We Must Rise to Face.","cites":["wd:Q7747:P800:Q27497617","wd:Q7747:P800:Q27874540","wd:Q7747:P800:Q27875715"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:02Z","text":"Russian helicopter suspected of violating Finnish airspace, DW reports.","cites":["news:dw:74b233a91706"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:09Z","text":"Russia strikes Zelenskyy's hometown, killing 2, DW reports.","cites":["news:dw:1c5b88d83c35"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:16Z","text":"Russia tests NATO’s eastern defences, France 24 reports.","cites":["news:france24:177315271fc4"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:23Z","text":"'Accept cookies'? Russia collects data from swaths of unknowing Swedes, France 24 reports.","cites":["news:france24:a6892ead2cc3"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:30Z","text":"BBC News headlined it: “Zelensky says Putin is a 'killer' after Trump calls Russian leader a friend”","cites":["news:bbc:6bd0be23632c"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:41Z","text":"Sources: BBC News, DW and France 24, Wikipedia articles, Wikimedia pageviews and Wikidata. Every caption links to the evidence it rests on.","cites":["wiki:rev:1386843956:366","views:en:Vladimir_Putin:30d","wd:Q7747:P569"]}],"time":"story","spotlight":{"country":"RU","lon":44.69,"lat":58.25,"label":"Russia"},"chapters":[{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:00Z","title":"What happened"},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:24Z","title":"Born"},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:32Z","title":"A life across the globe"},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:48Z","title":"Recognition"},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:02Z","title":"Lately in Russia"},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:30Z","title":"In the news"},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:41Z","title":"Sources"}],"panels":[{"id":"life","t":"2026-11-21T00:00:33Z","until":"2026-11-21T00:00:48Z","title":"A life on record","note":"As recorded in Wikidata (CC0). Organisations are placed at their home ground or headquarters.","kind":"facts","items":[{"label":"1952 born","text":"V.F. Snegiryov Maternity Hospital No.6","cites":["wd:Q7747:P19"]},{"label":"educated at","text":"Academy of the Federal Security Service of the Russian Federation","cites":["wd:Q7747:P69:Q2387574"]},{"label":"educated at","text":"Academy of Foreign Intelligence","cites":["wd:Q7747:P69:Q1978570"]},{"label":"1997","text":"Saint Petersburg Mining University","cites":["wd:Q7747:P69:Q2495829"]},{"label":"educated at","text":"Saint Petersburg State University","cites":["wd:Q7747:P69:Q27621"]},{"label":"educated at","text":"St. Petersburg Institute of the FSB of Russia","cites":["wd:Q7747:P69:Q103920735"]},{"label":"1952–80","text":"Baskov Lane 12, Mansion of Louise von Taube","cites":["wd:Q7747:P551:Q124616207"]},{"label":"1960–68","text":"School 193"